DEVICE SPIKE

# Robot Lab: lift the pallet 4 cm, hold it up there, put it back down.
# Model: Forklift (lift motor on C turns an 8-tooth gear on a rack).
# The gear's pitch radius is 4 mm, so 573 degrees (10 radians) lift the forks 40 mm.
WHEN flag clicked:
  set motor stop action C hold
  set motor speed C 30
  run motor C clockwise 573 degrees
  wait 5 seconds
  run motor C counterclockwise 573 degrees
